category: Libs
requires: libquo8 pkg-config
sdesc: "Dynamic execution environments for coupled, thread-heterogeneous MPI+X applications (development)"
ldesc: "QUO (as in 'status quo') is a runtime library that aids in accommodating
thread-level heterogeneity in dynamic, phased MPI+X applications comprising
single- and multi-threaded libraries."
external-source: libquo

